      },
      "Properties": {
        "ActionsEnabled": true,
        "AlarmDescription": "Automated Security Response on AWS: Messages in the slack notification channel DLQ. The channel Lambda failed to deliver notifications after SNS retries. Inspect the DLQ and CloudWatch logs for the SlackChannel Lambda.",
